        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Add it to your wishlist now and you will be notified as soon as the game is released~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of a waiter on a luxury cruise ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily tasks include cleaning guest rooms in the Guest Room Area to earn money, which can be spent at the Convenience Store located below the Commercial Area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely move around the ship, chatting with various NPCs and triggering unique storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs may irritate players, but player can use  superpower to make them admit their mistakes and improve the ship's environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Up to 20 characters with various professions and backgrounds* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managers, bodyguards, housewives, cleaning ladies, dancers, swimsuit sisters, waiters, financial experts, convenience store clerks, and more! Discover more characters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/fe8a85b05f6fb1837375f6d4bd707a4d.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/9fbfd5f7d284b23ded5319784e159249.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/5281b1c5b0f5eb85315e64a6760bb2a0.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/bc66668a54ad4b7806b206588fa74390.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The game includes a storyline ending* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can still play with your saved progress after the ending.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Add it to your wishlist now and you will be notified as soon as the game is released~</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players assume the role of a waiter on a luxury cruise ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily tasks include cleaning guest rooms in the Guest Room Area to earn money, which can be spent at the Convenience Store located below the Commercial Area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely move around the ship, chatting with various NPCs and triggering unique storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some NPCs may irritate players, but player can use  superpower to make them admit their mistakes and improve the ship's environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*Up to 20 characters with various professions and backgrounds* </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managers, bodyguards, housewives, cleaning ladies, dancers, swimsuit sisters, waiters, financial experts, convenience store clerks, and more! Discover more characters in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/fe8a85b05f6fb1837375f6d4bd707a4d.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/9fbfd5f7d284b23ded5319784e159249.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/5281b1c5b0f5eb85315e64a6760bb2a0.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987810/extras/bc66668a54ad4b7806b206588fa74390.avif?t=1788880449\" width=616 height=275 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*The game includes a storyline ending* </h2><p